BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 50 790 Td /F1 15 Tf (Second Normal Form \(2NF\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf T* () Tj T* (A relation is in 2NF if it is in 1NF and no non-key attribute depends on only) Tj T* (part of a composite key \(no partial dependency\).) Tj T* (Example: Enrollment\(RollNo, CourseID, StudentName, Grade\). StudentName depends) Tj T* (only on RollNo, so split into Student\(RollNo, StudentName\) and) Tj T* (Enrollment\(RollNo, CourseID, Grade\).) Tj T* ET
endstream
endobj
